# Fork release determinism: force LF in every text checkout so builds on ANY
# host produce byte-identical embedded resources. GitHub Actions windows-latest
# checks out with core.autocrlf=true by default — without this file the win-x64
# publish embeds CRLF variants of schemas/help/** and its --output-schema-crc
# diverges from the other RIDs (official v1.0.151 win-x64: b78ff09f vs
# 7a7d408f everywhere else), breaking the CRC-pinning contract for downstream
# automation that upgrades blind per-RID. Verified five-endpoint 2026-09-16:
# with LF checkouts all RIDs (incl. cross-published win-x64 from Linux) agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize (also protects auto-detection edge cases).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.glb binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
